            0.071
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.099,
            0.44,
            0.123
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验仪器、材料和试剂】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.132,
            0.914,
            0.174
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）仪器、用具:普通光学显微镜、50ml烧杯、玻璃滴管、容量瓶、试剂瓶、载玻片、盖玻片、镊子、小剪刀、吸水纸、擦镜纸。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.176,
            0.373,
            0.195
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 材料:洋葱鳞茎。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.197,
            0.264,
            0.216
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 试剂"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.218,
            0.917,
            0.279
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1）M缓冲液:50mmol/L咪唑、50mmol/L KCl、0.5mmol/L MgCl₂、1mmol/L EGTA [乙二醇双（α-氨基乙基醚）四乙酸]、0.1mmol/L EDTA、1mmol/L巯基乙醇或DTT（二硫苏糖醇）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.167,
            0.282,
            0.694,
            0.301
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2）6mmol/L（pH6.8）磷酸缓冲液（用  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "NaHCO_{3}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "  调 pH）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.168,
            0.303,
            0.539,
            0.322
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3）1% Triton X-100，用 M 缓冲液配制。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.324,
            0.915,
            0.364
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4）0.2%考马斯亮蓝 R250，其溶剂为:甲醇 46.5ml、冰醋酸 7ml、蒸馏水 46.5ml。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.168,
            0.367,
            0.453,
            0.386
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5）3%戊二醛，用2）液配制。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.388,
            0.508,
            0.407
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6）50%乙醇、70%乙醇、95%乙醇。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.409,
            0.548,
            0.429
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7）叔丁醇、正丁醇、二甲苯、中性树胶。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.439,
            0.309,
            0.463
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【方法与步骤】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.129,
            0.474,
            0.917,
            0.514
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）撕取洋葱鳞茎内表皮（约 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1\\mathrm{cm}^2"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 大小若干片）置于装有 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{pH6.8}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 磷酸缓冲液的"
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "50\\mathrm{ml}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 烧杯中，使其下沉。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.17,
            0.516,
            0.713,
            0.535
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 吸去磷酸缓冲液，用 1% Triton X-100 处理 20~30min。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.17,
            0.538,
            0.708,
            0.557
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 吸去 Triton X-100，用 M 缓冲液洗 3 次，每次 10min。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.171,
            0.559,
            0.445,
            0.578
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(4) 3%戊二醛固定0.5~1h。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.581,
            0.582,
            0.6
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) pH6.8 磷酸缓冲液洗 3 次，每次 10min。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.172,
            0.602,
            0.583,
            0.621
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(6) 0.2%考马斯亮蓝 R250 染色 20~30min。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.623,
            0.918,
            0.663
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（7）用蒸馏水洗 1 或 2 次，细胞置于载玻片上，加盖玻片，于普通光学显微镜下观察。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.666,
            0.541,
            0.684
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(8) 若观察效果好，可制作成永久切片:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.687,
            0.92,
            0.772
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "在有样品的 50ml 烧杯中，顺序通过如下药物:50%乙醇、70%乙醇、95%乙醇、1/2 V 95%乙醇+1/2 V 叔丁醇、叔丁醇（每级 5～10min）；或正丁醇、正丁醇、二甲苯、二甲苯（每级 5～10min），然后捞取样品，平展于载玻片上，经镜检，效果好的，可加一滴中性树胶，盖上盖玻片，即成永久片。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.133,
            0.781,
            0.23,
            0.805
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【作业】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 24,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.815,
            0.502,
            0.834
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）绘出植物细胞骨架微丝结构图。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 25,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.836,
            0.747,
            0.857
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 分析和论述在光学显微镜下观察到的细胞骨架的形态特征。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 26,
          "bbox": [
            0.83,
            0.88,
            0.92,
            0.898
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(戚康标)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
