          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "微管（microtubule）是真核细胞所特有并普遍存在的结构，它是由管蛋白（α和β管蛋白二聚体）和少量微管结合蛋白（MAP）聚合而成的管状纤维，在不同类型的细胞中微管具有相同的基本形态；管蛋白二聚体螺旋盘绕装配成微管的壁，13个二聚体绕一周，这是单管；它们又可以进一步组装成二联管（在纤毛和鞭毛）或三联管（在基体和中心粒）。观察微管可用电镜和免疫组织化学方法，其中较常用的有间接免疫荧光技术。用抗微管蛋白的免疫血清（一级抗体，如兔抗微管蛋白抗体）与细胞一起温育，该抗体将与胞质中的微管（抗原）特异结合，然后再加荧光素标记的抗球蛋白抗体［二级抗体，如异硫氰酸荧光素（FITC）标记的羊抗兔抗体］共同温育，该二抗与一抗结合，从而使微管间接地标上荧光素。置荧光显微镜下用一定波长激发光照射，即由荧光所在显示出微管的形态和分布。间接免疫荧光法特异和灵敏度均较高，广泛用于生物大分子或结构的定位和形态显示。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.565,
            0.432,
            0.588
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验仪器、材料和试剂】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.602,
            0.904,
            0.642
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）仪器、用具:荧光显微镜、冰箱、毛细吸管、放有湿纱布的铝盒、载玻片、35mm小染色缸、振荡器、指甲油。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.645,
            0.255,
            0.663
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 材料"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.667,
            0.456,
            0.684
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1）培养在盖玻片上的动物细胞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.121,
            0.688,
            0.908,
            0.77
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2）细胞涂片、组织块冰冻切片、石蜡切片、塑料包埋切片、铺片（小血管、胃肠道、胆管、心脏等可分层剥离铺片，用甲醛-明胶液粘片在载玻片上，注意某些动物细胞微管不发达、形态不典型，如分化成熟的红细胞、粒细胞、淋巴细胞、巨噬细胞等，一般不宜采用）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.773,
            0.257,
            0.791
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) 试剂"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.795,
            0.644,
            0.813
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1）0.01mol/L 磷酸盐缓冲生理盐水（PBS，pH7.2）:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.261,
            0.815,
            0.655,
            0.901
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_10_equation_16.jpg",
          "content": "\\begin{array}{l l} 0. 2 \\mathrm{mol/L} \\mathrm{Na} _ {2} \\mathrm{HPO} _ {4} & 7 7 \\mathrm{ml} \\\\ 0. 2 \\mathrm{mol/L} \\mathrm{NaH} _ {2} \\mathrm{PO} _ {4} & 2 3 \\mathrm{ml} \\\\ \\mathrm{NaCl} & 0. 1 5 \\mathrm{mol/L} \\\\ \\text {重蒸馏水} & \\text {至} 1 0 0 0 \\mathrm{ml} \\end{array}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 11,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.058,
            0.174,
            0.071
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "44"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.427,
            0.055,
            0.593,
            0.071
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "细胞生物学实验教程"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.091,
            0.658,
            0.172
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2) PEM 缓冲液:\npipes 80mmol/L\nEGTA 1mmol/L\nMgCl₂ 0.5mmol/L"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.174,
            0.901,
            0.214
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "用 NaOH 调 pH 至 6.9~7.0，注意先用 8mol/L 的浓 NaOH 调节，然后用较稀的 NaOH 溶液小心调制。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.216,
            0.729,
            0.235
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3）PEMD缓冲液:含1%二甲基亚砜（DMSO）的PEM溶液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.238,
            0.689,
            0.256
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "4）PEMP缓冲液:含 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4\\times"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 聚乙二醇（PEG）的PEM溶液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.259,
            0.495,
            0.277
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "5）固定液:3.7%甲醛-PEMD溶液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.28,
            0.496,
            0.298
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6) 0.5% Triton X-100/PEMP 溶液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.159,
            0.301,
            0.551,
            0.319
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7）1%和0.3%的Triton X-100/PBS溶液。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.322,
            0.904,
            0.384
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8）兔抗微管蛋白抗体（一抗）和 FITC-羊抗兔抗体（二抗）。使用前用 0.3% Triton X-100/PBS 或直接用 PBS 稀释 20 倍以上，一般第一抗体稀释度应更高。最好在使用前试验最佳工作稀释度，以特异性染色反应荧光最强而非特异性染色阴性为最佳。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.386,
            0.495,
            0.404
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "9）甘油-PBS（9:1），pH5.0～9.0。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.414,
            0.295,
            0.438
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【方法与步骤】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.119,
            0.449,
            0.904,
            0.489
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）细胞培养在裁成小条的盖玻片上，长到++至+++时取出，用PEMP缓冲液轻轻漂洗细胞。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.491,
            0.906,
            0.551
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) 0.5% Triton X-100/PEMP 溶液预温到 37℃，处理细胞 1.5~2min。Triton X-100 是非离子型去污剂，可适当增加细胞膜的通透性，使抗体容易进入细胞，同时 Triton X-100 抽提掉若干杂蛋白质使胞质背景清晰。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.554,
            0.386,
            0.571
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) PEMP 洗细胞 2 次。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.575,
            0.672,
            0.593
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(4) 用 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3.7\\%"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " 甲醛-PEMD溶液在室温下固定样品 "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "30\\mathrm{min}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.596,
            0.55,
            0.614
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) PBS 洗 2 次，用滤纸吸干多余的液体。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.617,
            0.906,
            0.657
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（6）结合一抗。用毛细吸管滴约 20pl 已经稀释的兔抗微管蛋白抗体放于载玻片中央，将盖片条的细胞面覆于其上，在 37℃ 湿盒内温育 60min。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.66,
            0.907,
            0.719
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（7）取出细胞样品，放 35mm 小染色缸内，按 PBS→1% Triton X-100/PBS→PBS 顺序漂洗细胞，每次 3~5min，可以放在振荡器上振荡漂洗。取出盖片条，用滤纸吸干液体。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.722,
            0.907,
            0.762
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（8）结合二抗。用已经稀释的 FITC-羊抗兔抗体与细胞温育 40～60min。操作步骤同（6），洗涤步骤同（7）。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.765,
            0.906,
            0.805
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（9）去离子水洗样品 2 次，稍干，滴加甘油-PBS 封片，四周涂指甲油封固。样品在  "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "4^{\\circ}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " C 置暗处可保存数天。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.368,
            0.815,
            0.667,
            0.838
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ⅱ.植物细胞微管的观察"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.846,
            0.271,
            0.869
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "【实验目的】"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.88,
            0.712,
            0.9
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "（1）学习用间接免疫荧光法显示植物原生质体质膜内的微管。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
